ngths instead of the entire session object.\",\"reasoning\":\"Stats computation runs on every tab change because session object reference changes. By memoizing on stable primitives (session.id, findings.length), we avoid O(n) iterations through findings array on every navigation.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:34:33.232Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:34:33.232Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
